  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Productive Inclusion and Resilience of Poor Rural Youth Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#xbf;s goal is to contribute to reducing poverty of rural youths and improve their families&#xbf; Quality of Life Index (QLI). The development objective is to improve youth beneficiaries&#xbf; positions in jobs or businesses, and to increase the resilience of these youths and their families to climate, social and economic shocks and stresses.</narrative>
  </description>
